### HEALTH CHECK (public)
GET http://localhost:3000/announcements

### SEARCH
GET http://localhost:3000/announcements?search=asus

### SORT + PAGINATION
GET http://localhost:3000/announcements?sort=oldest&page=1


### GET BY ID (existing)
GET http://localhost:3000/announcements/1

### GET BY ID (NOT FOUND)
GET http://localhost:3000/announcements/999999


### REGISTER USER
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "test_user",
  "password": "123456",
  "name": "Test"
}


### LOGIN USER
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "test_user",
  "password": "123456"
}


### SAVE TOKEN (MANUAL COPY FROM LOGIN RESPONSE)
# accessToken → вставь ниже
@token = YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE


### CREATE ANNOUNCEMENT (AUTH REQUIRED)
POST http://localhost:3000/announcements
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Продам ноутбук ASUS",
  "description": "Очень хороший ноутбук 16GB RAM",
  "price": 15000,
  "category": "sale",
  "contactInfo": "0991234567"
}


### UPDATE ANNOUNCEMENT (OWNER ONLY)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/announcements/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 14000
}


### DELETE ANNOUNCEMENT (OWNER ONLY)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/announcements/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### GET ME (AUTH)
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### LOGOUT
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### REFRESH TOKEN
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "PASTE_REFRESH_TOKEN_HERE"
}